# Like hello_dyn, dlopen_test never calls cap_request directly; the
# resources it touches (vfs.open on /lib/libfoo.so, vm_map of the
# segments) are mediated through the cap fs path that already gates
# library loading.  Present so exec_server's cap_provision is
# exercised for this dynamic image too.

name dlopen_test

